---
description: Ghost Network Auditor project rules for coding agents
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the rules in `AGENTS.md` at the repository root.

- Stay in your lane. Ask before editing files outside it.
- `contracts/` is the source of truth. Never change a contract without updating both sides in the same pull request.
- Agents query data only through gateway templates. Never write free-form SQL from an agent.
- Every claim carries receipt IDs. No receipt, no claim.
- Secrets live only in `.env`. Never commit keys, passwords or real personal data.
